      "statement": "\u2200 {X : Type u_1} {Y : Type u_2} (encode : X \u2192 Y) (x y : X) (test : Bool) (accept : Prop) [inst : Decidable accept],\n  (test = true \u2194 accept) \u2192 (if test = true then encode y else encode x) = encode (if accept then y else x)"
